"イラク": "Iraq",
"パレスチナ": "Palestine",
"トランスヨルダン": "Transjordan",
"A 式委任統治 (国際連盟規約第 22 条第 4 項)、受任国 (mandatory)、「文明の神聖なる信託」、常設委任統治委員会 (PMC)": "Class A mandate (Covenant of the League of Nations, Art. 22(4)), mandatory, “a sacred trust of civilisation”, Permanent Mandates Commission (PMC)",
"法では「独立国として承認されるまでの暫定の助言と援助」で、受任国は連盟に年次報告を出し、門戸開放 (他の連盟国への無差別) と宗教の自由を負う。イラクは王国の形 (1921 年に英が選んだファイサルを住民投票で国王に) で英の顧問が財政・司法・軍に付き、1922 年の英イラク条約と 1930 年の条約 (空軍基地・同盟) を経て 1932 年 10 月 3 日に連盟に加盟。パレスチナは英の直接行政で A 式の名に合わない。実態は英仏の植民地と近く、PMC の議事録がその差を記録している": "De jure, “provisional” advice and assistance until recognition as an independent state; the mandatory submitted annual reports to the League and was bound to the open door (non-discrimination toward other League members) and freedom of religion. Iraq took the form of a kingdom (Faisal, chosen by Britain, made king by plebiscite in 1921), with British advisers attached to finance, justice and the army; after the Anglo-Iraqi Treaty of 1922 and the 1930 treaty (air bases, alliance), it joined the League on October 3, 1932. Palestine was under direct British administration and did not fit the Class A label. De facto, the mandates were close to British and French colonies, and the PMC minutes record the gap",
"国際連盟規約第 22 条 (第 4 項 旧トルコ領、第 7 項 年次報告、第 9 項 常設委任統治委員会)、各委任状の本文 (パレスチナ委任状 1922 年 7 月 24 日、シリア・レバノン委任状 1922 年)、英イラク条約 (1922 年 10 月 10 日。1924 年批准) と 1930 年 6 月 30 日の条約 (第 1 条 同盟、第 5 条 基地)、PMC の議事録 (国際連盟文書庫、ジュネーヴ。デジタル化済み: LONTAD)、Wright 1930『Mandates under the League of Nations』(当時の法理)": "Covenant of the League of Nations, Art. 22 (para. 4 former Turkish territories, para. 7 annual reports, para. 9 Permanent Mandates Commission); the texts of the individual mandates (Mandate for Palestine, July 24, 1922; Mandate for Syria and the Lebanon, 1922); Anglo-Iraqi Treaty (October 10, 1922; ratified 1924) and the treaty of June 30, 1930 (Art. 1 alliance, Art. 5 bases); PMC minutes (League of Nations Archives, Geneva; digitized: LONTAD); Wright 1930, Mandates under the League of Nations (legal doctrine of the time)",
"Pedersen 2015『The Guardians』(PMC が帝国を「国際化」した)、Anghie 2005、Wright と Lauterpacht の「主権はどこにあるか」(受任国・連盟・住民) の論争 (1920 年代)、Dodge 2003『Inventing Iraq』。論点: 委任統治は植民地の言い換えか新しい型か、報告と監視は実態を変えたか": "Pedersen 2015, The Guardians (the PMC “internationalized” empire), Anghie 2005, the 1920s debate between Wright and Lauterpacht on “where sovereignty lies” (mandatory, League or inhabitants), Dodge 2003, Inventing Iraq. Issues: was the mandate a renamed colony or a new type; did reporting and oversight change practice",
"連盟 (第三者の監視機関) そのものを置かない。報告の義務は史料の欄 (H4) で代える": "The League itself (a third-party oversight body) is not modeled. The reporting duty is represented by the sources field (H4)",
"シリア": "Syria",
"レバノン": "Lebanon",
