"ルアンダ=ウルンディ (B)": "Ruanda-Urundi (B)",
"南西アフリカ (C)": "South West Africa (C)",
"B 式・C 式委任統治 (規約第 22 条第 5・6 項)、信託統治 (国連憲章第 12 章、1946〜1994)、「自国の領土の一部として」(C 式)": "Class B and C mandates (Covenant Art. 22(5)–(6)), trusteeship (UN Charter Chapter XII, 1946–1994), “as integral portions of its territory” (Class C)",
"法では受任国が行政・立法を握るが、B 式は要塞と基地の禁止・住民の軍事訓練の制限・奴隷取引の禁止・門戸開放 (交易の無差別) を負い、C 式は門戸開放の義務がなく「領土の一部として」治める。宗教の自由と宣教の自由は両方が負う。実態は植民地と同じで、南西アフリカは南アフリカに併合されかけた (委任の撤回 1966、独立 1990)。信託統治は国連の監視が強まり (請願と現地視察)、独立の期限が入った": "De jure, the mandatory held administration and legislation; Class B carried a ban on fortifications and bases, limits on military training of the inhabitants, a ban on the slave trade and the open door (non-discrimination in trade), while Class C had no open-door obligation and was governed “as integral portions” of the mandatory’s territory. Both carried freedom of religion and of missionary work. De facto, they were the same as colonies, and South West Africa was nearly annexed by South Africa (mandate revoked 1966, independence 1990). Trusteeship brought stronger UN oversight (petitions and visiting missions) and introduced deadlines for independence",
"国際連盟規約第 22 条第 5・6 項、各委任状 (タンガニーカ 1922 年 7 月 20 日、南西アフリカ 1920 年 12 月 17 日、南洋群島 1920 年 12 月 17 日)、国連憲章第 75〜85 条、信託統治協定 (太平洋諸島 1947 年 4 月 2 日。安保理決議 21「戦略地区」)、PMC と信託統治理事会の議事録、ICJ 勧告的意見「南西アフリカの国際的地位」(1950)。ICOW の注 (タンガニーカ・カメルーン・ナミビア・ナウル・マーシャル) が、委任と信託を経た国を記録している": "Covenant of the League of Nations, Art. 22(5)–(6); the individual mandates (Tanganyika, July 20, 1922; South West Africa, December 17, 1920; South Seas Islands, December 17, 1920); UN Charter, Arts. 75–85; trusteeship agreements (Pacific Islands, April 2, 1947; Security Council Resolution 21, “strategic area”); minutes of the PMC and the Trusteeship Council; ICJ advisory opinion, International Status of South-West Africa (1950). ICOW’s notes (Tanganyika, Cameroon, Namibia, Nauru, Marshall Islands) record the states that passed through mandate and trusteeship",
"Pedersen 2015、Callahan 1999/2004 (アフリカの委任統治は植民地と違ったか)、Peattie 1988『Nan'yō』(日本の南洋群島)。論点: B と C の差は実態にあったか (Pedersen: 門戸開放の差だけ)、信託統治は脱植民地化を早めたか": "Pedersen 2015, Callahan 1999/2004 (did the African mandates differ from colonies), Peattie 1988, Nan’yō (Japan’s South Seas Islands). Issues: was the B/C difference real in practice (Pedersen: only the open door differed); did trusteeship speed up decolonization",
"B と C の差は「交易の門戸開放」の 1 項目の差にする。国連の請願の仕組み": "The B/C difference is reduced to a single item, the open door in trade. The UN petition mechanism",
