"サモア (三国共同統治)": "Samoa (tripartite condominium)",
"condominium (共同統治)、Anglo-Egyptian Sudan、「英埃」。アンドラの共同公 (co-princes) は中世からの別の形": "condominium, Anglo-Egyptian Sudan, “Anglo-Egyptian”. Andorra’s co-princes are a separate form dating from the Middle Ages",
"法では 2 つの宗主が対等に治める。英埃協定は両国旗を掲げ (第 2 条)、総督はエジプト政府が英の推薦で任命し英の同意なく解けず (第 3 条)、総督の布告が法で、領事裁判権は及ばない。実態は英が握り、エジプトは資金と兵を出す側だった。ニューヘブリディーズは英仏が別々の行政・裁判所・警察を持ち、住民は「どちらの法にも属さない」状態が長く続いた。イスラム法の家族法 (カーディー裁判所) は残った": "De jure, two suzerains govern as equals. The Anglo-Egyptian Agreement flew both flags (Art. 2); the governor-general was appointed by the Egyptian government on British recommendation and could not be removed without British consent (Art. 3); the governor-general’s proclamations were law, and consular jurisdiction did not apply. De facto, Britain held control, and Egypt supplied money and troops. In the New Hebrides, Britain and France each ran separate administrations, courts and police, and the inhabitants long remained “subject to neither law”. Islamic family law (qadi courts) remained",
"英埃共同統治協定 (1899 年 1 月 19 日。第 2 条 両国旗、第 3 条 総督、第 4 条 総督の布告が法、第 8 条 混合裁判所の排除)、英仏のニューヘブリディーズ議定書 (1906 年 10 月 20 日、1914 年 8 月 6 日)、スーダン政府の年次報告 (Reports on the Finances, Administration and Condition of the Sudan)、TNA FO 78・FO 371、スーダン文書館 (ダラム大学 Sudan Archive)": "Anglo-Egyptian Condominium Agreement (January 19, 1899; Art. 2 both flags, Art. 3 governor-general, Art. 4 proclamations as law, Art. 8 exclusion of the Mixed Courts); the Anglo-French New Hebrides protocols (October 20, 1906; August 6, 1914); the Sudan Government’s annual reports (Reports on the Finances, Administration and Condition of the Sudan); TNA FO 78 and FO 371; Sudan Archive (Durham University)",
"Daly 1986『Empire on the Nile』(共同統治は英の植民地の擬装)、Collins 1983。論点: 2 つの宗主の分担をどう測るか (法は対等、実態は片方)": "Daly 1986, Empire on the Nile (the condominium as a disguised British colony), Collins 1983. Issue: how to measure the division between two suzerains (equal in law, one-sided in practice)",
"2 人の宗主を 1 つの従属関係として持てないので、ゲームでは「宗主が 2 国」を持たないかぎり入らない。入れるなら、宗主の側の配分の項目が要る": "A single dependency cannot hold two suzerains, so this type is not included unless the game supports “two suzerain nations”. Including it would need an allocation field on the suzerain side",
