"free association (国連総会決議 1541 (XV) 1960 年の原則 6・7)、Compact of Free Association (COFA、自由連合盟約)、「戦略的拒否権」(strategic denial)、associated state": "free association (UN General Assembly Resolution 1541 (XV), 1960, Principles VI and VII), Compact of Free Association (COFA), “strategic denial”, associated state",
"法でも実態でも、軍事だけを宗主が握る。COFA (1986) の第 3 編: 米が防衛の全権と、第三国の軍の立入を拒む権利を持ち (第 311 条)、クェゼリンの基地を使う (第 312 条)。外交は自前 (第 121 条) だが防衛に関わるものは協議 (第 123 条)。課税は自前で、米から援助を受ける (第 211 条。向きが逆の「朝貢」)。クック諸島は NZ が防衛と (協議のうえで) 外交を持ち、住民は NZ 国籍。総会決議 1541 は「連合の形を自由に選び、単独で変えられる」ことを条件にする": "Both de jure and de facto, the suzerain holds only the military. COFA (1986), Title Three: the US has full authority for defense and the right to deny access to third-country forces (Section 311), and uses the base at Kwajalein (Section 312). Foreign affairs are the state's own (Section 121), but matters touching defense require consultation (Section 123). Taxation is the state's own, and it receives US assistance (Section 211; “tribute” flowing the other way). For the Cook Islands, NZ holds defense and (after consultation) foreign affairs, and residents are NZ citizens. Resolution 1541 requires that the form of association be freely chosen and changeable unilaterally",
"Compact of Free Association (米公法 99-239、1986 年 1 月 14 日。第 121・123・211・311・312 条)、パラオの盟約 (米公法 99-658、1994 年 10 月 1 日発効)、Cook Islands Constitution Act 1964 (NZ)、国連総会決議 1541 (XV) (1960 年 12 月 15 日) 付属書の原則 6・7、信託統治理事会の議事録 (1947〜94)": "Compact of Free Association (US Public Law 99-239, January 14, 1986; Sections 121, 123, 211, 311, 312), Palau Compact (US Public Law 99-658, in force October 1, 1994), Cook Islands Constitution Act 1964 (NZ), annex to UN General Assembly Resolution 1541 (XV) (December 15, 1960), Principles VI and VII, Trusteeship Council records (1947–94)",
"Igarashi 2002『Associated Statehood in International Law』、Hanlon 1998『Remaking Micronesia』(援助への依存)、Keitner & Reisman 2003。論点: 自由連合は独立か従属か、軍事だけの従属は安定するか": "Igarashi 2002, “Associated Statehood in International Law”; Hanlon 1998, “Remaking Micronesia” (aid dependence); Keitner & Reisman 2003. Debates: is free association independence or dependence; is a military-only dependency stable",
"住民の国籍 (NZ 国籍・米への自由な移住)、援助の額の交渉 (20 年ごとの更新)": "Residents' citizenship (NZ citizenship, free migration to the US), negotiation of aid amounts (renewed every 20 years)",
