"<h3>忠誠と独立</h3>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>忠誠度の目標の内訳</th><th></th></tr>{0}<tr><th>目標</th><th>{1}</th></tr></table></div>\n    <p class=\"note\">いまの忠誠度 <b>{2}</b> (年に最大5ずつ目標へ動く)。恐怖度 <b>{3}</b> → 目標 {4} (駐留する{5}の艦隊 {6} / 反乱時の推定艦隊 {7})。友好度 <b>{8}</b> → 目標 {9} (主人筋との貿易 {10} cr/年)。</p>\n    {11}\n    <p class=\"note {12}\">{13}</p>{14}{15}": "<h3>Loyalty and independence</h3>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>Loyalty target breakdown</th><th></th></tr>{0}<tr><th>Target</th><th>{1}</th></tr></table></div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Current loyalty <b>{2}</b> (moves toward the target by up to 5 per year). Fear <b>{3}</b> → target {4} (fleets of {5} stationed: {6} / estimated rebel fleets: {7}). Friendship <b>{8}</b> → target {9} (trade with the overlord’s side {10} cr/yr).</p>\n    {11}\n    <p class=\"note {12}\">{13}</p>{14}{15}",
