"<details class=\"note hist\" data-h=\"hist\" {0}><summary>史料 — {1}</summary>\n    <label class=\"field\">型<select data-act=\"histtype\">{2}</select></label>\n    <p class=\"muted\">{3}{4}の家族。束 (事例の最頻) 法 {5}・実態 {6}。事例 {7} 件の存続の中央値 {8}</p>\n    {9}{10}<p><b>事例 (事例のデータ)</b> {11}</p>{12}{13}{14}\n    <p class=\"muted\">符号化は 2 人が別々に行い (一致 α = 0.754)、食い違いを裁定した。条文の番号は本文がデジタル化されている 17 件だけ原文で確かめた。出典の一覧は data/raw/vassal/ (README・sources_checked.md)</p></details>": "<details class=\"note hist\" data-h=\"hist\" {0}><summary>Sources — {1}</summary>\n    <label class=\"field\">Type<select data-act=\"histtype\">{2}</select></label>\n    <p class=\"muted\">{3}{4} family. Bundle (modal case): de jure {5}, de facto {6}. Median duration of {7} cases: {8}</p>\n    {9}{10}<p><b>Cases (case data)</b> {11}</p>{12}{13}{14}\n    <p class=\"muted\">Coded independently by two coders (agreement α = 0.754), with disagreements adjudicated. Article numbers were checked against the original text only for the 17 cases whose texts are digitized. Source list: data/raw/vassal/ (README, sources_checked.md)</p></details>",
