"<div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>主権の束</th><th>法 (約定)</th><th>実態</th></tr>{0}</table></div>\n    <p class=\"muted\">宗 = 宗主が握る・分 = 分け合う・従 = 従属国が握る。法 = 約定の文、実態 = 実際の力関係。法と実態の差 <b class=\"{1}\">{2} 項目</b> (この型の始め {3}・歴史の平均 {4})。型の始めより 1 項目増えるごとに離反が {5} 倍起きやすい (事例 131 件)。\n    {6}\n    {7}</p>": "<div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>Bundle of sovereignty</th><th>De jure (treaty)</th><th>De facto</th></tr>{0}</table></div>\n    <p class=\"muted\">S = held by the suzerain, M = shared, V = held by the dependency. De jure = the treaty text, de facto = the actual balance of power. De jure–de facto gap <b class=\"{1}\">{2} items</b> (start of this type {3}, historical average {4}). Each item above the type’s starting gap makes secession {5} times as likely (131 cases).\n    {6}\n    {7}</p>",
"いまの型と直轄": "Current type & direct rule",
"{0}<div class=\"regimes\"><p class=\"muted\">統治体制 (従属国の型) — いまは <b>{1}</b>。変えるのは光速の指令 (政治力 {2}・届くまで {3} 年)。離反は、いま変えたときの見込み</p>{4}{5}</div>\n    <details class=\"note\"><summary>数値の根拠</summary>{6}<p class=\"muted\">離反の起きやすさ = 基準 × 型の倍率 × 通信の遅れ ÷ 1 世代 ({7} 年) × 人口の比 × 忠誠度。型の倍率は法と実態の差から (植民地は COLDAT の推定)。自治を狭める変更は、法の束の点が下がった分だけ忠誠度が下がる (2 点で −{8})。</p></details>": "{0}<div class=\"regimes\"><p class=\"muted\">Form of rule (dependency type) — currently <b>{1}</b>. Changing it is a light-speed directive ({2} political capital, {3} yr to arrive). Secession figures are projections if changed now</p>{4}{5}</div>\n    <details class=\"note\"><summary>Basis for the numbers</summary>{6}<p class=\"muted\">Secession hazard = baseline × type multiplier × communication delay ÷ one generation ({7} years) × population ratio × loyalty. Type multipliers come from the de jure–de facto gap (colonies from COLDAT estimates). A change that narrows autonomy lowers loyalty in proportion to the drop in de jure bundle points (−{8} per 2 points).</p></details>",
