"<h3>交易路</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">余っている資源を、足りない星系へ自動で運ぶ (0.95c の貨物船)。交易路でつながっていれば、複数の交易路を乗り継いで届ける。荷は受け手が基準価格で買い取る (送り手の輸出収入になる)。代金を払えない星系は、主人から支援として無償で受け取れるが、そのぶん従属が深まる (忠誠度が上がる)。</p>\n    {0}{1}{2}": "<h3>Trade routes</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Surplus resources are shipped automatically to systems that lack them (0.95c cargo ships). Where routes connect, cargo is relayed over several routes. The receiver buys the cargo at the base price (export income for the sender). A system that cannot pay may receive it free as support from its overlord, at the cost of deeper dependence (loyalty rises).</p>\n    {0}{1}{2}",
"<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autoroutes\" {0}> {1}と直轄の星系の混んだ交易路 (稼働率9割超) を自動で拡張する</label>": "<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autoroutes\" {0}> Automatically expand congested trade routes (over 90% utilization) of {1} and direct-rule systems</label>",
"<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autodefense\" {0}> {1}自動防衛配備</label>\n    <label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autobuild\" {2} {3}> 足りない艦隊は自動で編成</label>\n    <p class=\"note\">年に1回、各入植星系の駐留艦隊を海賊の最大戦力 (いま <b>{4}</b> 艦隊、{5}年から40年ごとに増える) まで増やす。余っている艦隊を近くから回し、足りなければ{6}の軍事基地で編成する (資金が費用の2倍以上あるとき、年5艦隊まで。ほかの星系は自分で海賊対策の建艦をする)。命令で送った艦隊 (遠征・攻め落とした星系の守り) と威圧の艦隊は動かさない。{7}と、海賊が現れる前は1艦隊。目標に届いていない入植星系: {8} か所</p>\n    {9}": "<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autodefense\" {0}> {1}Auto defense deployment</label>\n    <label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autobuild\" {2} {3}> Raise missing fleets automatically</label>\n    <p class=\"note\">Once a year, each colonized system's garrison is brought up to the pirates' maximum strength (now <b>{4}</b> fleets, rising every 40 years from {5}). Spare fleets are moved in from nearby; any shortfall is raised at the military base in {6} (only while funds are at least twice the cost, up to 5 fleets a year; other systems build their own ships against pirates). Fleets sent by order (expeditions, garrisons of conquered systems) and intimidation fleets are not moved. The target for {7}, and for any system before pirates appear, is 1 fleet. Colonized systems below target: {8}</p>\n    {9}",
"<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autoawe\" {0}> {1}反乱防止のための威圧</label>\n    <p class=\"note\">年に1回、{2}の直属の従属星系に、反乱 (独立戦争) を起こしたときにその星系が持つであろう艦隊 (人口と経済の規模から推定) の<b>2倍</b>の艦隊を{3}から送って駐留させる (海賊対策の駐留とは別に数える。忠誠度が50以上か、主人との友好度が{4}以上の星系には送らず、そうなった星系からは威圧の艦隊を{5}へ引き揚げる。忠誠度の低い順。足りない艦隊は「足りない艦隊は自動で編成」がオンなら、{6}で資金と資源の続く限り編成)。{7}の艦隊が駐留している星系は<b>恐怖度</b> (忠誠度とは別) が上がり (推定艦隊と同数で50、2倍で100。年に最大10ずつ動く)、恐怖度が高いほど独立を宣言しにくくなる (100で確率が1/10)。それでも独立されたら、駐留していた艦隊はその場で独立軍と艦隊戦になり、勝てば攻囲に移る。威圧の対象 (直属で忠誠度50未満・友好度{8}未満) {9} か所のうち、目標に届いていない: {10} か所</p>": "<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autoawe\" {0}> {1}Intimidation to prevent rebellion</label>\n    <p class=\"note\">Once a year, {3} sends to each of {2}'s direct vassal systems a garrison <b>twice</b> the fleet that system would field if it rebelled (war of independence), estimated from its population and economy. These are counted separately from anti-pirate garrisons. No fleets are sent to systems with loyalty 50 or higher or with friendship {4} or higher toward their overlord, and intimidation fleets are withdrawn from such systems to {5}. Lowest loyalty first. If \"Raise missing fleets automatically\" is on, any shortfall is raised at {6} as long as funds and resources last. Systems where {7}'s fleets are stationed gain <b>fear</b> (separate from loyalty): 50 with as many fleets as the estimate, 100 with twice as many, moving at most 10 a year. The higher the fear, the less likely a declaration of independence (1/10 the chance at 100). If the system declares independence anyway, the stationed fleets fight the independence forces on the spot and, if they win, lay siege. Intimidation targets (direct vassals with loyalty under 50 and friendship under {8}): {9}, of which below target: {10}</p>",
