"<h3>軍事</h3>\n    {0}\n    {1}{2}\n    {3}\n    {4}\n    <p class=\"note\">{5}駐留艦隊 <b>{6}</b>{7}。宇宙海賊の襲撃 ({8}年以降) を防ぎ、先住民の制圧にも使う。1艦隊あたり維持費 {9} cr/年。艦隊は直行し、交易路が直接結ぶ区間は 0.95c、それ以外は 0.9c。0.9c の 1 艦隊の運動エネルギーは {10} (恐竜を滅ぼした衝突の約 {11} 万倍) で、ぶつかれば惑星の表面を焼き尽くす</p>\n    {12}{13}{14}": "<h3>Military</h3>\n    {0}\n    {1}{2}\n    {3}\n    {4}\n    <p class=\"note\">{5}Garrison <b>{6}</b>{7}. Defends against space pirate raids (from {8} on) and is also used to subdue natives. Upkeep {9} cr/yr per fleet. Fleets fly direct: 0.95c on legs directly linked by a trade route, 0.9c elsewhere. The kinetic energy of 1 fleet at 0.9c is {10} (about {11} × 10,000 times the impact that killed the dinosaurs); an impact would scorch a planet's surface</p>\n    {12}{13}{14}",
