"<details class=\"strike\"><summary class=\"bad\">光速の一撃 (取り消せない)</summary>\n    <p class=\"note\">艦隊を減速させずに {0} へ突っ込ませる。1 艦隊で 1 つの天体の入植地を焼き (人口の {1}% だけが地下に残り、施設・備蓄・歩兵はなくなる)、艦隊は残らない。光の遅れで、{2}には着く直前 (約 {3} 年前) まで見えず、止められない。\n      知らせが光速で届いた国は宣戦する (撃たれた国はかならず、{4} 光年以内の国は {5}%)。自国の家臣は忠誠度が {6} 下がり、悪名が {7} 増える。いま知っている天体は {8} つ。</p>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><button data-act=\"strike\" data-from=\"{9}\" data-n=\"1\" class=\"bad\">1 艦隊で突入</button>{10}</div></details>": "<details class=\"strike\"><summary class=\"bad\">Relativistic strike (irreversible)</summary>\n    <p class=\"note\">Fleets are flown into {0} without decelerating. One fleet burns the colony on one body (only {1}% of the population survives underground; facilities, stockpiles and troops are lost), and the fleet is destroyed. Because of light delay, {2} cannot see it until just before impact (about {3} years before) and cannot stop it.\n      Realms the news reaches at light speed declare war (the target always; realms within {4} light-years with {5}% probability). Your vassals lose {6} loyalty and infamy rises by {7}. Bodies currently known: {8}.</p>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><button data-act=\"strike\" data-from=\"{9}\" data-n=\"1\" class=\"bad\">Strike with 1 fleet</button>{10}</div></details>",
