"<p class=\"note\">宇宙要塞 <b>Lv{0}</b> / {1}{2}。艦隊戦では段の数だけ要塞の区画 (艦の {3} 倍の耐久、退かない) が守りに加わる。区画が沈むと段が下がる。艦隊がいなくても、要塞があれば攻める艦隊は先に艦隊戦をする。</p>\n    {4}": "<p class=\"note\">Space fortress <b>Lv{0}</b> / {1}{2}. In fleet battles, one fortress section per level (durability {3}× a ship, never retreats) joins the defense. When a section is destroyed, the level drops. Even with no fleet present, attacking fleets must first fight a fleet battle against the fortress.</p>\n    {4}",
