"<h3>{0}歩兵</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">駐留: 歩兵 <b>{1}</b> 連隊・奴隷兵 <b>{2}</b> 連隊{3}。\n      軍事教練所 Lv{4}{5}。\n      歩兵は先住民の制圧・奴隷の反乱の抑止・海賊からの地上防衛に使う。1連隊で人口 {6} を徴集、維持費 {7} cr/年。</p>\n    {8}{9}": "<h3>{0}Troops</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Garrison: troops <b>{1}</b> regiments · slave soldiers <b>{2}</b> regiments{3}.\n      Training grounds Lv{4}{5}.\n      Troops subdue natives, deter slave revolts and defend the ground against pirates. Each regiment drafts {6} of the population; upkeep {7} cr/yr.</p>\n    {8}{9}",
