"<p class=\"note bad\">征服戦争中 — 進捗 {0}。入植地の戦力 {1} (歩兵 + 星系の艦隊の半分 + 入植者の民兵) と先住民の残りの戦力 {2} が毎年削り合う (先住民は疲弊して年7%ずつも弱る)。劣勢になると入植船を送った星系が歩兵を送り込む。</p>\n    <span class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:{3}%\"></i></span>": "<p class=\"note bad\">Conquest war in progress — progress {0}. Each year the colony's strength {1} (troops + half the system's fleets + settler militia) and the natives' remaining strength {2} wear each other down (the natives also weaken by 7% a year from exhaustion). If the colony falls behind, the system that sent the colony ship sends in troops.</p>\n    <span class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:{3}%\"></i></span>",
