"\n    {0}\n    <p class=\"note\">奴隷化すると市場奴隷になり、あとで軍事奴隷・家畜に切り替えられる。悪名 +15 (他の先住民の友好度が下がり、同じ惑星の入植地は不穏になる)。</p>": "\n    {0}\n    <p class=\"note\">Enslaved natives become market slaves and can later be switched to military slaves or livestock. Infamy +15 (other natives' friendship falls; colonies on the same planet become restless).</p>",
"\n    <div class=\"btns\">{0}</div>\n    <p class=\"note\">市場奴隷: 労働力として食料・金属・希少元素・工業品を産む (消費されず、寿命で入れ替わる)。<br>\n      軍事奴隷: 安価な歩兵 (戦力 {1}・維持費 {2} cr/年) として毎年徴集され、同じ惑星の入植地に配属される。<br>\n      家畜: 食料を大量に産む。初めて家畜にすると悪名がさらに +15。<br>\n      産出: {3} /年。奴隷の人口は年1.5%増える。艦隊+歩兵の戦力が {4} 未満 (いま {5}) だと年5%の確率で反乱が起きる。</p>": "\n    <div class=\"btns\">{0}</div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Market slaves: produce food, metal, rare elements and goods as labor (not consumed; replaced as they die of age).<br>\n      Military slaves: drafted every year as cheap troops (strength {1}, upkeep {2} cr/yr) and assigned to colonies on the same planet.<br>\n      Livestock: produce large amounts of food. The first use of livestock adds a further +15 infamy.<br>\n      Output: {3} /yr. The slave population grows 1.5% a year. If fleet + troop strength is below {4} (now {5}), there is a 5% chance of revolt each year.</p>",
