"<p class=\"note\">{0}\n      拠点があると友好度は少しずつ上がる。40以上で交易 (収入・希少元素) が可能。80以上なら市民として迎えられる。制圧すると貢納を得るが、他の先住民の友好度が下がる。制圧には艦隊が1つ以上と、艦隊+歩兵の戦力が必要。制圧後は奴隷化もできる。</p>": "<p class=\"note\">{0}\n      With a foothold here, friendship rises slowly. At 40 or higher, trade (income, rare elements) is possible. At 80 or higher they can be welcomed as citizens. Subduing them yields tribute but lowers other natives' friendship. Subduing requires at least 1 fleet and enough fleet + troop strength. Once subdued, they can also be enslaved.</p>",
