"<h3>入植船を送る</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">入植船は{0}が{1}から送り出す (費用は{2}の資金と{3}の備蓄から。その場で出発の準備に入る)。新しい入植地は{4}に従属する。ほかの星系の政府は自分の判断で入植する。</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">入植船は交易路をたどって (0.95c) 目的地に最も近い星系まで行き、最後だけ交易路の外を 0.9c で直行する{5}。到着まで <b>{6}</b>{7}。</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">入植船は食料と水を約 {8} 年分 (交易路を結んで物資が届き始めるまでの見込み、人口の伸びも見込んで2倍) 積んでいき、入植先の備蓄にする。\n      惑星入植地: 食料 {9}・水 {10} / ステーション: 食料 {11}・水 {12}</p>\n    {13}\n    {14}\n    <div class=\"btns\">{15}{16}</div>": "<h3>Send colony ship</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Colony ships are dispatched by {0} from {1} (costs come from {2}'s funds and {3}'s stockpile; preparations for departure begin at once). The new colony is subordinate to {4}. Other system governments colonize at their own discretion.</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">Colony ships follow trade routes (0.95c) to the system nearest the destination and fly only the last leg off-route at 0.9c{5}. Travel time: <b>{6}</b>{7}.</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">Colony ships carry about {8} years of food and water (the expected time until a trade route starts delivering, doubled to allow for population growth) as the new colony's stockpile.\n      Planetary colony: food {9} · water {10} / station: food {11} · water {12}</p>\n    {13}\n    {14}\n    <div class=\"btns\">{15}{16}</div>",
