"<p class=\"note\">交易路を結ぶには入植星系が2つ以上必要。</p>": "<p class=\"note\">Trade routes require at least 2 colonized systems.</p>",
"<div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\">\n      <tr><th>区間 (A ⇄ B)</th><th>距離</th><th>規模</th><th>A→B</th><th>B→A</th><th>稼働率</th><th>通過中の荷 A→B</th><th>通過中の荷 B→A</th><th></th></tr>{0}</table></div>\n      <p class=\"note\">稼働率が100%近い交易路は、拡張すると運べる量が増える。稼働率が9割を超えると知らせが出て、端の星系 (A) の政府が自動で拡張する (資金が費用の1.5倍以上あるとき)。</p>": "<div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\">\n      <tr><th>Leg (A ⇄ B)</th><th>Distance</th><th>Capacity</th><th>A→B</th><th>B→A</th><th>Utilization</th><th>In transit A→B</th><th>In transit B→A</th><th></th></tr>{0}</table></div>\n      <p class=\"note\">Routes near 100% utilization carry more when expanded. Above 90% utilization a notice is issued and the government of the end system (A) expands the route automatically (when its funds are at least 1.5× the cost).</p>",
"<p class=\"note\">まだ交易路はない。</p>": "<p class=\"note\">No trade routes yet.</p>",
"<div class=\"kpi\">\n      <div><span>{0}交易路 (把握分)</span><b>{1} 本</b><span>各星系が自分で引く</span></div>\n      <div><span>{2}の輸出収入</span><b>{3} cr</b><span>年あたり</span></div>\n      <div><span>{4}の輸入支出</span><b>{5} cr</b><span>年あたり</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <h3>新しい交易路</h3>{6}\n    {7}\n    <h3>{8}交易路の一覧</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">送れる量は輸送船の数と港の容量 (規模) の小さいほうで、質量 (100 万 t) で数える。船は 30 年で古くなり、交易路を開いた星系の運送業の会社が運賃で造り直し、港が広がったら足す。</p>\n    {9}\n    {10}": "<div class=\"kpi\">\n      <div><span>{0}Trade routes (known)</span><b>{1}</b><span>each system opens its own</span></div>\n      <div><span>{2} export income</span><b>{3} cr</b><span>per year</span></div>\n      <div><span>{4} import spending</span><b>{5} cr</b><span>per year</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <h3>New trade route</h3>{6}\n    {7}\n    <h3>{8}Trade route list</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Capacity is the lesser of the cargo ship count and port capacity (scale), measured in mass (1 million t). Ships wear out after 30 years; the shipping companies of the system that opened the route rebuild them from freight revenue and add more when the port expands.</p>\n    {9}\n    {10}",
