"<h3>通信 (物資移送要求・指令・朝貢) {0} 件</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">情報は光速でしか伝わらない。資源が足りない星系や建設地は、交易路でつながった送り手へ物資移送要求を送り、要求が届いてから荷が出発する。地図での表示はヘッダーの「通信」ボタンで切り替える: 表示しない / 光の点 (見かけの位置の点と点線。届いて処理中の要求は送り手に輪)。色は紫: 交易、黄: 建設資材、水色: 指令、緑: 朝貢、金: 資金援助。</p>\n    {1}": "<h3>Communications (supply requests, directives, tribute): {0}</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Information travels only at light speed. Systems short of resources and construction sites send supply requests to senders connected by trade route, and cargo departs only after the request arrives. Toggle the map display with the \"Communications\" button in the header: hidden / light dots (a dot and dotted line at the apparent position; a ring at the sender for requests that have arrived and are being processed). Colors: purple, trade; yellow, construction materials; light blue, directives; green, tribute; gold, subsidies.</p>\n    {1}",
