"<h3>外交</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">協定は 3 種類 ({0})。どれも {1} 年。申し入れは光速で相手の首都に届き、相手はそこで決める。受けた時点から相手が縛られ、返事が光速で戻った時点から{2}が縛られる。\n      相手は、首都に届いている古い光で見た{3}の艦隊 (読み違いつき) と、近くの国の艦隊から決める。下の見込みは、地球に届いている記録での見立て。協定の相手に宣戦するか、同盟の参戦を断ると<b>破約</b>になり、議会の支持 −{4}、{5} 年のあいだ、どの国も協定を受けにくくなる{6}。</p>\n    {7}\n    {8}\n    {9}": "<h3>Diplomacy</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">There are 3 kinds of pact ({0}). Each lasts {1} years. An offer travels at the speed of light to the other state’s capital, where it is decided. The other side is bound from the moment it accepts; {2} is bound from the moment the reply arrives back at the speed of light.\n      The other side decides from {3}’s fleets as seen in the old light reaching its capital (with misjudgment), and from the fleets of nearby states. The outlook below is an estimate from the records that have reached Earth. Declaring war on a pact partner, or refusing to join a war under an alliance, is a <b>breach</b>: council support −{4}, and for {5} years every state is less willing to accept pacts{6}.</p>\n    {7}\n    {8}\n    {9}",
