"<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"migration\" {0}> {1}恒星間移民を許可する</label>\n    <label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autohabitat\" {2}> 過密な入植地の居住区を自動で拡張する</label>\n    <p class=\"note\">人口が上限の90%を超えた入植地では、居住区の拡張 (オンのとき) と移民が同時に進む。年に1回、人口の3% (上限を超えていれば5%) が移民船で出ていく。行き先は食料と水が足りている入植地のうち、空き (上限の80%まで) が大きく、近いところ。</p>\n    <div class=\"kpi\">\n      <div><span>過密な入植地</span><b>{3} か所</b><span>上限の90%以上</span></div>\n      <div><span>移動中 (把握分)</span><b>{4}</b><span>移民船 {5} 隻</span></div>\n      <div><span>最近の到着 (把握分)</span><b>{6}</b><span>直近 {7} 便</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <h3>過密な入植地 (上限の85%以上)</h3>\n    {8}\n    <h3>受け入れ先 (空きの大きい順)</h3>\n    {9}\n    <h3>移動中の移民船</h3>\n    {10}\n    <h3>到着の記録</h3>\n    {11}": "<label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"migration\" {0}> {1}Allow interstellar migration</label>\n    <label class=\"check auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"autohabitat\" {2}> Expand habitats of overcrowded colonies automatically</label>\n    <p class=\"note\">In a colony whose population exceeds 90% of its cap, habitat expansion (when on) and emigration proceed together. Once a year, 3% of the population (5% if over the cap) leaves by migrant ship. The destination is a colony with enough food and water, chosen for the most room (up to 80% of its cap) and the shortest distance.</p>\n    <div class=\"kpi\">\n      <div><span>Overcrowded colonies</span><b>{3}</b><span>90% of cap or more</span></div>\n      <div><span>In transit (known)</span><b>{4}</b><span>{5} migrant ships</span></div>\n      <div><span>Recent arrivals (known)</span><b>{6}</b><span>Last {7} voyages</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <h3>Overcrowded colonies (85% of cap or more)</h3>\n    {8}\n    <h3>Destinations (most room first)</h3>\n    {9}\n    <h3>Migrant ships in transit</h3>\n    {10}\n    <h3>Arrival record</h3>\n    {11}",
