"<div class=\"kpi\">\n    <div><span>{0}クレジット</span><b>{1} cr</b><span class=\"{2}\">{3}{4}/年</span></div>\n    <div><span>エネルギーの蓄え</span><b>{5}</b><span>発電 {6}/年</span></div>\n    <div><span>{7}総人口 (把握分)</span><b>{8}</b><span>入植地 {9}・星系 {10}</span></div>\n    <div><span>{11}艦隊 (把握分)</span><b>{12} 艦隊</b><span>駐留している分</span></div>\n    <div><span>{13}交易路 (把握分)</span><b>{14} 本</b><span></span></div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"note\">資金と収支は{15}のもの。各星系の数値は、その星系から光が{16}に届いた時点の様子 (表の「情報」が古さ)。</p>": "<div class=\"kpi\">\n    <div><span>{0}Credits</span><b>{1} cr</b><span class=\"{2}\">{3}{4}/yr</span></div>\n    <div><span>Energy reserve</span><b>{5}</b><span>Generation {6}/yr</span></div>\n    <div><span>{7}Total population (known)</span><b>{8}</b><span>{9} colonies · {10} systems</span></div>\n    <div><span>{11}Fleets (known)</span><b>{12} fleets</b><span>Stationed</span></div>\n    <div><span>{13}Trade routes (known)</span><b>{14}</b><span></span></div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"note\">Funds and balance are those of {15}. Figures for each system show it as it was when its light reached {16} (the “Info” column gives the age).</p>",
"<h3>{0}{1}の収支 (cr/年)</h3><table class=\"tbl\">{2}</table>\n    <h3>{3}のエネルギー (J/年)</h3><table class=\"tbl\">{4}</table>\n    <p class=\"note\">エネルギーはダイソン・スウォームの発電 (恒星の光を覆う割合 {5})。船は加速をレーザー光帆、減速を交易路では着く側のレーザー、交易路の外では磁気帆と反物質で行う。蓄えは {6} 年分の発電まで。</p>\n    {7}": "<h3>{0}{1} balance (cr/yr)</h3><table class=\"tbl\">{2}</table>\n    <h3>{3} energy (J/yr)</h3><table class=\"tbl\">{4}</table>\n    <p class=\"note\">Energy comes from the Dyson swarm (share of starlight covered: {5}). Ships accelerate on laser light sails; they decelerate using the receiving end’s lasers on trade routes, and magnetic sails and antimatter off them. Reserves hold up to {6} years of generation.</p>\n    {7}",
