"<div class=\"kpi\">\n      <div><span>{0}艦隊 (把握分)</span><b>{1} 艦隊</b><span>駐留している分</span></div>\n      <div><span>{2}歩兵 (把握分)</span><b>{3} 連隊</b><span>駐留している分</span></div>\n      <div><span>{4}海賊の最大戦力</span><b>{5}</b><span>{6}</span></div>\n      <div><span>悪名</span><b>{7}</b><span>先住民の友好度に影響</span></div>\n    </div>\n    {8}\n    {9}\n    {10}\n    <h3>歩兵</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">歩兵は入植地ごとに駐留し、交易路を通って移動する。軍事教練所 (惑星・ステーションの施設) で訓練するか、軍事奴隷から徴集する。先住民の制圧、奴隷の反乱の抑止、海賊からの地上防衛に使う。</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>入植地</th><th>教練所</th><th>歩兵</th><th>奴隷兵</th><th>向かっている</th><th>訓練</th><th></th></tr>{11}</table></div>\n    <h3>征服戦争 ({12})</h3>{13}{14}\n    <h3>移動中の歩兵</h3>{15}\n    <h3>移動中の艦隊</h3>{16}\n    <h3>艦隊への指令 (光速で送信中)</h3>{17}": "<div class=\"kpi\">\n      <div><span>{0}Fleets (known)</span><b>{1} fleets</b><span>Stationed</span></div>\n      <div><span>{2}Troops (known)</span><b>{3} regiments</b><span>Stationed</span></div>\n      <div><span>{4}Pirate peak strength</span><b>{5}</b><span>{6}</span></div>\n      <div><span>Infamy</span><b>{7}</b><span>Affects native friendship</span></div>\n    </div>\n    {8}\n    {9}\n    {10}\n    <h3>Troops</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Troops are stationed by colony and move along trade routes. They are trained at training grounds (a planet or station facility) or levied from military slaves. They are used to subdue natives, deter slave revolts, and defend the ground against pirates.</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>Colony</th><th>Training grounds</th><th>Troops</th><th>Slave soldiers</th><th>En route</th><th>Training</th><th></th></tr>{11}</table></div>\n    <h3>Conquest wars ({12})</h3>{13}{14}\n    <h3>Troops in transit</h3>{15}\n    <h3>Fleets in transit</h3>{16}\n    <h3>Fleet directives (in transit at the speed of light)</h3>{17}",
