"<h3>艦隊戦の報告</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">艦隊戦は自動で進む。1 艦隊は耐久と組織力を持ち、1 年に {0} 回撃ち合う。組織力が尽きた艦は撃たれながら退き、近くの自国の星系へ戻る (退ける先がなければ最後まで戦う)。大きすぎる艦隊はまとまって動けず、数の差は二乗則ほどには効かない (2 倍の兵力で勝つのは 4 回に 3 回ほど)。戦機 (索敵・先に撃つ側) と士気は戦いごとに引く。沈んだ艦の乗員 {1} が戦死者になる (仮の値)。交戦は光速近くで一瞬に近づいて行われるが、ここでは時間をかけた撃ち合いとして解く。見込みは、同じ形の戦いを 64 回解いた割合。終わりの知らせが首都に届いた戦いだけを載せる。</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>星系</th><th>攻撃 対 防衛 (艦隊)</th><th>勝った国</th><th>損害 (攻撃 / 防衛)</th><th>戦死</th><th>効いたもの (攻撃 / 防衛)</th></tr>{2}</table></div>": "<h3>Fleet battle reports</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Fleet battles resolve automatically. Each fleet has durability and organization, and exchanges fire {0} times a year. Ships whose organization runs out withdraw under fire and return to a nearby system of their own (if there is nowhere to withdraw to, they fight to the end). Oversized fleets cannot move as one, so numbers count for less than the square law suggests (twice the strength wins about 3 times in 4). Initiative (detection, firing first) and morale are drawn for each battle. {1} crew per ship sunk are counted as killed (provisional value). An engagement at near light speed is over almost in an instant, but here it is resolved as a drawn-out exchange of fire. Odds are the share of wins over 64 runs of the same battle. Only battles whose end has been reported to the capital are listed.</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>System</th><th>Attack vs defense (fleets)</th><th>Victor</th><th>Losses (attack / defense)</th><th>Killed</th><th>Deciding factors (attack / defense)</th></tr>{2}</table></div>",
