"<p>禁輸: {0}</p>": "<p>Embargo: {0}</p>",
"<h3>価格統制と交易の規制</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">値段の上限: 市場の値段をこの倍率 × 基準の値段で止める (足りない分は不足になる。闇市の分だけ効かない)。配給: 不足のとき、星系の在庫を入植地の人口に比べて分ける。輸出禁止: ほかの国の買い手に売らない。禁輸: その国とは売りも買いもしない。どれも財政の法案として議会の審議にかかる。値段は{0}の市場の、基準の値段に対する倍率</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>資源</th><th>いまの値段</th><th>値段の上限</th><th>配給</th><th>輸出禁止</th></tr>{1}</table></div>\n    {2}\n    <h3>政府の倉</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">公的備蓄: 星系の政府の倉に、星系のふだんの消費の何か月分を持つか (常平倉。値段がふだんより安いとき市場から買い、高いとき売って、値段をならす)。価格の下限: 値段がこの倍率 × 基準の値段より下がらないように、政府が市場から買って倉に入れる (量の上限はなく、お金は星系の政府が払う)。値段の上限は、闇市の分 (上限との差の {3}%) だけ効かない。どれも財政の法案として議会の審議にかかる</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>資源</th><th>公的備蓄</th><th>価格の下限</th><th>国の倉</th></tr>{4}</table></div>": "<h3>Price controls and trade restrictions</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Price ceiling: market prices are held at this multiple of the base price (the shortfall becomes a shortage, and the ceiling leaks by the black-market share). Rationing: in a shortage, the system's stock is shared among colonies by population. Export ban: no sales to buyers in other nations. Embargo: no buying from or selling to that nation. All of these go to the council for debate as a public finance bill. Prices are the market prices of {0} as a multiple of the base price</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>Resource</th><th>Current price</th><th>Price ceiling</th><th>Rationing</th><th>Export ban</th></tr>{1}</table></div>\n    {2}\n    <h3>Government granary</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">Public stocks: how many months of the system’s usual consumption the system government keeps in its granary (an ever-normal granary: it buys from the market when prices are below normal and sells when they are above, smoothing prices). Price floor: to keep the price from falling below this multiple of the base price, the government buys from the market into the granary (no quantity limit; the system government pays). The price ceiling fails by the black-market share ({3}% of the gap to the ceiling). All of these go to the council as a finance bill</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>Resource</th><th>Public stocks</th><th>Price floor</th><th>Realm granary</th></tr>{4}</table></div>",
