"<h3>財政のグラフ</h3><p class=\"note\">首都に届いた記録から 1 年に 1 回 (遠い星系の分は光の年数だけ古い)。点線は財政を変えた年 (触れると中身)。伸びと収支は前の年も記録のあった星系だけで比べる。</p>\n    <div class=\"chips\">{0}</div><div class=\"fcharts\">{1}</div>{2}": "<h3>Fiscal charts</h3><p class=\"note\">Once a year, from records that have reached the capital (distant systems are older by their light-years). Dotted lines mark years when fiscal policy changed (touch for details). Growth and balance compare only systems that also had a record the year before.</p>\n    <div class=\"chips\">{0}</div><div class=\"fcharts\">{1}</div>{2}",
