"<h3>帰着 (標準の財政と比べた 1 年の損得)</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">いまの帳簿の大きさに率の差を掛けた見込み [cr/年。+ が得]。買い物や輸入の量の変化は入れていない。所得の分位は国の家計の 5 分位 (下 → 上) の、分位の所得に対する割合。家計の分を、現実の国の帰着の調べ (所得税は上に、消費税・関税・福祉は下に重い) で分け、会社の分は持ち主 (ほとんどいちばん上の分位) に分けた。集団の忠誠度の差にも同じ分け方で効く</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>手段</th><th>家計</th><th>会社</th><th>政府</th><th>ほかの国</th><th>所得の分位</th><th>行政の遅れ</th></tr>{0}</table></div>": "<h3>Incidence (yearly gains and losses vs. the standard finances)</h3>\n    <p class=\"note\">An estimate from the current ledgers times the change in rates [cr/yr; + is a gain]. Changes in purchases or imports are not included. Income quintiles are the nation's household quintiles (bottom → top), as a share of each quintile's income. The household part is split using real-world incidence studies (income tax weighs on the top; consumption tax, tariffs and welfare on the bottom), and the firm part goes to owners (mostly the top quintile). Group loyalty differences use the same split</p>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>Instrument</th><th>Households</th><th>Firms</th><th>Government</th><th>Other nations</th><th>Income quintiles</th><th>Administrative lag</th></tr>{0}</table></div>",
"<h3>支出の 10 機能</h3><p class=\"note\">国の政府 (首都と従属星系) の 1 年の支出を、国連の政府の機能の分類 (COFOG) で分けたもの。建設は経済業務、研究の予算と国債の利子は一般公共サービス、年金は社会保護、医療は保健に入る。右の列は OECD の国の平均 (参考)</p>\n    <table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>機能</th><th>cr/年</th><th>割合</th><th>OECD の平均</th></tr>{0}</table>": "<h3>Spending by function</h3><p class=\"note\">The realm's government (capital and vassal systems) spending over a year, split by the UN Classification of the Functions of Government (COFOG). Construction counts as economic affairs, the research budget and bond interest as general public services, pensions as social protection and health care as health. The right column is the OECD average (for reference)</p>\n    <table class=\"tbl\"><tr><th>Function</th><th>cr/yr</th><th>Share</th><th>OECD average</th></tr>{0}</table>",
