"<h2>候補地 <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px\">ハビタブルゾーン内の未入植の天体 {0} 件{1}</span></h2>\n    <div class=\"bulk\">\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"candonly\" {2}> 地表に入植できる天体だけ</label>\n      並び順 <select data-act=\"candsort\"><option value=\"rec\" {3}>おすすめ順</option><option value=\"dist\" {4}>首都から近い順</option><option value=\"grade\" {5}>入植適性の高い順</option></select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl cands\">\n      <tr><th>天体・{6}入植船を送る</th><th>{7}首都から</th><th>種類</th><th>{8}入植適性</th><th>{9}気温・{10}重力・{11}大気圧</th><th>{12}先住民</th><th>{13}資源</th></tr>\n      {14}</table></div>\n    <p class=\"note\">入植船は首都から出る。地表に入植できない天体には宇宙ステーション (回って遠心力で重力を作る居住区) を送る。入植船が向かっている天体は色付きで、到着までの年数を表示する。</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">おすすめ順: 入植適性 (地表に住めないならステーション) の高さを、首都からの距離で割り引いた順 (適性 ÷ (1 + 距離/6 光年)²。6 光年で 4 分の 1、12 光年で 9 分の 1)。首都と同じ星系の天体は、時代の課題の「星系の数」に数えないので下に回す (資源や人口のために送るのはよい)。</p>": "<h2>Candidates <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:13px\">{0} uncolonized bodies in habitable zones{1}</span></h2>\n    <div class=\"bulk\">\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"candonly\" {2}> Only bodies with a colonizable surface</label>\n      Sort <select data-act=\"candsort\"><option value=\"rec\" {3}>Recommended</option><option value=\"dist\" {4}>Nearest to capital</option><option value=\"grade\" {5}>Best suitability</option></select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"tbl cands\">\n      <tr><th>Body · {6}send colony ship</th><th>{7}From capital</th><th>Type</th><th>{8}Suitability</th><th>{9}Temp. · {10}gravity · {11}pressure</th><th>{12}Natives</th><th>{13}Resources</th></tr>\n      {14}</table></div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Colony ships depart from the capital. Bodies without a colonizable surface receive a space station (a habitat that rotates to create gravity by centrifugal force). Bodies with a colony ship on the way are highlighted and show the years until arrival.</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">Recommended order: suitability (station suitability if the surface is uninhabitable), discounted by distance from the capital (suitability ÷ (1 + distance/6 ly)²: one quarter at 6 ly, one ninth at 12 ly). Bodies in the capital’s own system do not count toward the era objective “number of systems”, so they are listed lower (sending ships there for resources or population is still fine).</p>",
"<span class=\"k\">{0}資金</span><span class=\"v\">{1} cr</span> <span class=\"{2}\">{3}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\" style=\"margin-left:16px\" title=\"政治力 ({4}の意志): 星系の政府への指令に使う。年ごとに貯まる\">{5}政治力</span><span class=\"v\">{6}</span> <span class=\"muted\">{7}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\" style=\"margin-left:16px\" title=\"{8}の支持: 15を割ると政権交代\">{9}議会</span><span class=\"v {10}\">{11}</span>": "<span class=\"k\">{0}Funds</span><span class=\"v\">{1} cr</span> <span class=\"{2}\">{3}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\" style=\"margin-left:16px\" title=\"Political capital (the will of {4}): spent on directives to system governments. Accrues each year\">{5}Political capital</span><span class=\"v\">{6}</span> <span class=\"muted\">{7}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\" style=\"margin-left:16px\" title=\"{8} support: below 15 the government falls\">{9}Council</span><span class=\"v {10}\">{11}</span>",
