"<section><h3>プレイ記録</h3>\n    <p class=\"muted\">自分がどう遊んだかを記録する (このブラウザの中だけ。開発者に届くのは「記録を書き出す」で作ったファイルを自分で送ったときだけ)。{0}ヘッダーの「メモ」で、退屈・分からない・迷う・面白いと感じた瞬間を、その時点の状態と一緒に残せる。</p>\n    <div class=\"row\">{1}</div>\n    <details class=\"help\"><summary>同意の文</summary><p><b>{2}</b><br>{3}</p><ul>{4}</ul></details>\n    {5}\n    {6}\n  </section>": "<section><h3>Play log</h3>\n    <p class=\"muted\">Records how you play (in this browser only; it reaches the developer only if you yourself send the file made with “Export record”). {0} Use “Memo” in the header to mark moments that felt boring, confusing, uncertain or fun, together with the game state at that point.</p>\n    <div class=\"row\">{1}</div>\n    <details class=\"help\"><summary>Consent text</summary><p><b>{2}</b><br>{3}</p><ul>{4}</ul></details>\n    {5}\n    {6}\n  </section>",
