"<section><h3>Firebase の設定</h3>\n      <p class=\"note\">{0}Firebase のコンソールで作ったウェブアプリの設定 (firebaseConfig の JSON) を貼ると、この端末だけで使える。</p>\n      <textarea id=\"acct-cfg\" rows=\"4\" placeholder='{\"apiKey\": \"…\", \"authDomain\": \"…\", \"projectId\": \"…\", \"appId\": \"…\"}'>{1}</textarea>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button data-home=\"acctcfg\">設定を使う</button><button class=\"ghost\" data-home=\"acctcfgdel\">貼った設定を消す</button></div></section>": "<section><h3>Firebase configuration</h3>\n      <p class=\"note\">{0}Paste the configuration of a web app created in the Firebase console (the firebaseConfig JSON) to use it on this device only.</p>\n      <textarea id=\"acct-cfg\" rows=\"4\" placeholder='{\"apiKey\": \"…\", \"authDomain\": \"…\", \"projectId\": \"…\", \"appId\": \"…\"}'>{1}</textarea>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button data-home=\"acctcfg\">Use configuration</button><button class=\"ghost\" data-home=\"acctcfgdel\">Remove pasted configuration</button></div></section>",
"<section><h3>アカウント</h3><p>アカウントを作ると、セーブと自作の国をクラウドに置いて別の端末でも使えるようになり、ネット対戦も部屋のコードだけでつなげる。</p></section>{0}{1}": "<section><h3>Account</h3><p>With an account, saves and custom nations are kept in the cloud and can be used on other devices, and online matches connect with just a room code.</p></section>{0}{1}",
